Owns project presentation and connected market/locality experience. It must use the established routes and existing source contracts.

### F06 — Save / compare

Owns save/compare presentation and adapters to actual persistence capabilities.

### F07 — My HOMIO

Owns the user's continued property journey, recently viewed, saved content and pending action presentation.

### F08 — AI

Owns AI user experience and contextual interaction. It is not a business authority.

### F09 — Enquiry / visit

Owns enquiry and visit user flows while using existing REOS contracts.

### F10 — Transaction

Owns user-facing transaction progress and evidence views. Canonical transaction/commission data stays in REOS.

### F11 — Professional SaaS

Owns role-aware professional interfaces and adapters. Server-side authorization remains authoritative.

### F12 — Globalization

Owns locale, country/market configuration, address formatting, currency, units, localization and market activation presentation.

### F13 — Production quality

Owns verification wiring, accessibility, performance, security-boundary checks, media rules and SEO presentation.

Do not introduce a duplicate engine simply because a target folder or module name appears here.

